## KeyPressRemoteCommand

Simulates keyboard input on the remote PC by sending key press events. Supports single keys, key combinations, and modifier keys with customizable timing and randomness. Use this for automating keyboard input or triggering keyboard shortcuts.

_Object containing the following properties:_

| Property                   | Description                                                                                       | Type                                                            |
| :------------------------- | :------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ | :-------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **`destination`** (\*)     | Remote PC from ips or aliases section to send this command to                                     | [VariableValue](#variablevalue) _or_ `string`                   |
| `delayAfter`               | Delay (ms) after command completes, before next command. Ensures command has time to take effect. | [VariableValue](#variablevalue) _or_ `number`                   |
| `delayBefore`              | Delay (ms) before executing command. Helps create precisely timed sequences.                      | [VariableValue](#variablevalue) _or_ `number`                   |
| **`performOnRemote`** (\*) |                                                                                                   | `'keyPress'`                                                    |
| **`variables`** (\*)       |                                                                                                   | [KeyPressRemoteCommandVariable](#keypressremotecommandvariable) |

_(\*) Required._

## KeyPressRemoteCommandVariable

_Object containing the following properties:_

| Property            | Description                                                                                                                                 | Type                                                                               | Default |
| :------------------ | :------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ | :--------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | :------ |
| **`key`** (\*)      | Key(s) to press. Can be a single key or array of keys for multiple presses.                                                                 | [Key](#key) _or_ _Array of [Key](#key) items_ _or_ [VariableValue](#variablevalue) |         |
| `duration`          | How long to hold the key down in milliseconds. Recommended minimum 50ms to ensure reliable key registration.                                | `number` (_≥50_) _or_ [VariableValue](#variablevalue)                              |         |
| `durationDeviation` | Adds randomness to key press duration. Value is the maximum +/- deviation in milliseconds. Useful for simulating human-like input patterns. | `number` (_≥0_) _or_ [VariableValue](#variablevalue)                               | `0`     |
| `holdKeys`          | Modifier keys to hold (e.g., Alt for Alt+1, Ctrl+Shift for Ctrl+Shift+A). Can be a key or key array.                                        | [Key](#key) _or_ _Array of [Key](#key) items_ _or_ [VariableValue](#variablevalue) |         |

_(\*) Required._

