## MacroDefinitionVariableValue

JSON Schema for the variable value. Supports standard JSON Schema: {"type": "string"}, {"type": "number"}, {"type": "object", "properties": {...}}, {"type": "array", "items": {...}}, {"anyOf": [...]}, {} (any value). Use "default" to provide a default value (also marks the variable as optional). Use "x-optional": true to mark as optional without a default value.

